DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Oh! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Na los, rein mit euch!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich hab
mir hier schon die Beine in den
Bauch gestanden!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aw, man, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}. Don't get so
worked up! {{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's not a big deal!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}I just have this thing I borrowed
from someone, but I forget who!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Any chance it could be yours?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Off, {{TAG:0011:0001:0100}}. Bu kadar gerilme! {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Önemli
bir şey değil!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Birinden ödünç aldığım
bir şey var ama
kimden aldığımı unuttum!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Acaba senin olabilir mi?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Don't be nervous! Just listen! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}I'm
pretty sure you'll like what I have to
say, dude!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Remember that thing you were 
asking about?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} I got my hands on it!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¡Oye, tranqui, no te pongas así!
Atiende, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}te voy a decir algo que
te va a encantar, ¡palabrita!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Te acuerdas de aquella cosita
que me pediste?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} ¡Pues ya la
he conseguido!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Non essere nervosa! Calmati e
ascolta!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Sono sicura che quello
che ho da dirti ti piacerà.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ti ricordi quella cosa che mi avevi
chiesto?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Ci ho pensato io!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Einatmen, ausatmen, einatmen,
ausatmen! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Alles wird gut, glaub mir!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Du hast mich doch nach so 'nem
Dingsbums gefragt, weißte noch?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Ich hab so was in der Art gefunden!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Gerilme! Dinle yeter! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Söyleyeceğim şeyi
seveceğine bayağı eminim!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hani sorduğun şu şey vardı ya?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
İşte onu buldum!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oooh, du hast es ausprobiert?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Das ist ja prima, {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Hihihi!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Wenn ich dich so ansehe,
bekomme ich den Eindruck, dass
es dir geschmeckt hat!
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Ich sag es ja schon immer, {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0005:001A:00CD}} aus {{TAG:0005:0005:}} ist
alles, was man zum Kochen braucht!
Schön, dass es geschmeckt hat!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Und danke fürs Herbringen,
{{TAG:0005:0008:}}.
Oh, ich muss das gleich allen
erzählen!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}} Ich wollte dich unbedingt was
fragen!{{TAG:0003:0006:}} Ich hab gehört, dass ein
Blumenwettbewerb stattfindet.
Das Thema soll „{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0001:}}
{{TAG:0005:0021:00CD}} im Fokus“
oder so lauten{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}} Weißte da mehr zu?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}I was a little surprised when I heard
someone was looking for me, but
I'm glad I came by!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Thanks so much, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} This
was all your doing!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}OK, I'll just be going then!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Good-bye! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ero un po' stupefatta quando ho
sentito che qualcuno mi cercava,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
ma sono contenta di essere venuta!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Merci merci merci, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
È stato tutto merito tuo!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Va bene, ora tolgo il disturbo!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Adieu! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ich war ja schon überrascht, als ich
gehört habe, dass du mich suchst.
Aber gut, dass ich hier war!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Vielen Dank, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ohne dich wäre das nicht
möglich gewesen!
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Also dann!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Tschüsschen, {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Birinin beni aradığını duyunca biraz şaşırdım,
ama geldiğime sevindim!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0004:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Çok teşekkür ederim, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hepsi
senin sayende oldu!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Pekâlâ, ben artık gideyim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hoşça kal! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
